        "@value": "autochtone Child Removals - the Sixties Scoop - The Gord Downie &amp; Chanie Wenjack Fund"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Content warning: This post contain information about residential schools. Colleen Hele-Cardinal is a Sixties Scoop survivor and co-founder of the Sixties Scoop Network. She is nehiyaw iskwew (Plains Cree) from Saddle Lake Cree Nation, AB but was adopted and raised in Sault Ste Marie, ON."
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Colleen Hele-Cardinal est une survivante du Sixties Scoop et cofondatrice du Sixties Scoop Network. Elle est nehiyaw iskwew (Cri des plaines) et vient de la nation crie de Saddle Lake, en Alberta, mais a été adoptée et élevée à Sault Ste Marie, en Ontario."
      }
    ],
