    "https://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Le Gord Downie &amp; Chanie Wenjack Fund et la Société Canadian Tire élargissent leur partenariat pour soutenir Oshki Wupoowane | Les fonds des couvertures - The Gord Downie &amp; Chanie Wenjack Fund"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Le Gord Downie &amp; Chanie Wenjack Fund (FDC) est fier d&#039;annoncer un partenariat élargi avec La Société Canadian Tire Limitée (CTC). S&#039;appuyant sur notre relation existante, la CCT soutiendra désormais Oshki Wupoowane | Les fonds des couvertures  des couvertures (The Blanket Fund), une initiative nationale qui soutient les projets et organisations culturels, artistiques et éducatifs autochtone autochtone et des autochtone."
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "The Gord Downie &amp; Chanie Wenjack Fund (DWF) is proud to announce an expanded partnership with Canadian Tire Corporation, Limited (CTC). Building on our existing relationship, CTC will now support Oshki Wupoowane | The Blanket Fund (The Blanket Fund), a national initiative that empowers Indigenous and Indigenous-led cultural, artistic, and educational projects and organizations."
      }
    ],
