        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "To help you take #reconciliACTION while you shop for your loved ones this holiday season, we’ve put together DWF’s first-ever Holiday Gift Guide. Below you will find 12 Indigenous-owned businesses, the new DWF Merch Store, and of course, The Bay’s iconic Point Blankets, which support Oshki Wupoowane | The Blanket Fund. Happy Holidays!"
      },
