  {
    "@id": "_:g7888760",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "When Canadian Tire learned that it had come out on top of a bidding war to own the Hudson’s Bay stripes this summer, one of its marketing executives said the feeling was comparable only to the most magical time of year.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tYour first look at what Canadian Tire is doing with the Hudson’s Bay stripes | City News\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7888840",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Music and storytelling come together for a moving evening in support of the Gord  Downie & Chanie Wenjack Fund at Black Bellows Parlour Room on Friday, Nov. 7.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tFriday show at Black Bellows pays tribute to Gord Downie’s music and legacy | Collingwood Today\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7888920",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Gord Downie was a well-known advocate for environmental and Indigenous concerns. He spent the last few months of his life speaking out in support of Indigenous people. His last major project was Secret Path, a multimedia project about the life of Chanie Wenjack.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tGord Downie | The Canadian Encyclopedia\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7889000",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Community members gathered at Riverbend Park on Oct. 21 for the Walkerton Walk for Wenjack, one of many events of its kind supporting the Downie-Wenjack Fund (DWF) and raising awareness of the impacts of residential schools.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tWalk for Wenjack inspires reconciliation efforts across Bruce County | MNC\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7889080",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This holiday season, take #reconciliACTION by purchasing gifts from DWF’s Holiday Gift Guide. This guide features Indigenous-owned businesses, with options for all budgets and preferences. There is something meaningful for every person on your list!\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tDWF Holiday Gift Guide – 2025\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7889160",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Students and staff at Kew Beach Junior Public School came together in an inspiring act of learning and remembrance by participating in the Walk for Chanie Wenjack from October 20 to 24, 2025.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tKew Beach Junior Public School Walk for Chanie Wenjack | Toronto District School Board\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7889240",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Actions speak louder then words-they always have and they always will. So when the Loyalist Township celebrated the opening the a Downie-Wenjack Legacy Room at the W.J. Henderson Arena on Monday, it meant something. Progress. Follow through. Action.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tPutting Reconciliation into Action | The Napanee Beaver\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7889320",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "People gathered in Amhertsview, Ont., this week to celebrate the opening of the latest Downie Wenjack Fund legacy space.\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tFormer residential school student remembered through legacy space program | APTN News\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g7889400",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Family members of the late Gord Downie were at the W.J. Hendweson Arena on Monday to officially open a Downie-Wenjack Legacy Room. The space, just inside the main entrance, is dedicated to reflection and reconciliation, a stark reminder of the injustices carried out by the Canadian government towards First Nations. \n"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\tDownie Wenjack Legacy Centre Officially open at Amherstview’s W.J. Henderson Arena | The Napanee Beaver\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "communications"
      }
    ]
  },
